item.description:
Image Source
Absorbent underwear has come a long way from the bulky, obviously medical products of a decade ago. Today&#8217;s versions look and fit more like regular underwear, which matters for both comfort and the wearer&#8217;s confidence.&#160;
As more adults manage incontinence at home rather than in clinical settings, the market has responded with pull-on designs that prioritize discretion, breathability, and independence.
